Um, so I was thinking in
prep for when pigs fly

00:00:06.590 --> 00:00:08.109
and she actually comes on my show

00:00:08.109 --> 00:00:09.750
could you show me the impression?

00:00:09.750 --> 00:00:10.583
Could you show us?

00:00:10.583 --> 00:00:11.416
- Yeah!

00:00:11.416 --> 00:00:12.720
Close your eyes, just picture her.

00:00:12.720 --> 00:00:14.410
She's here.
- Yeah, she's here.

00:00:14.410 --> 00:00:15.773
- Oh, wooh.

00:00:16.615 --> 00:00:18.826
(laughing)

00:00:18.826 --> 00:00:20.447
Oh, Kelly.

00:00:20.447 --> 00:00:22.783
You don't want me on your show, nope.

00:00:24.226 --> 00:00:29.226
Oh, I couldn't, (exhales loudly) come on.

00:00:29.455 --> 00:00:32.622
