00:00:47.890 --> 00:00:49.770
they're like, they've
gotta be like $1,000,

00:00:49.770 --> 00:00:50.603
they're so cute.

00:00:50.603 --> 00:00:52.437
- Yeah, and they're so like
- Designer

00:00:52.437 --> 00:00:53.490
- on the very tip of her nose too.

00:00:53.490 --> 00:00:55.170
- But with the glasses, it was funny.

00:00:55.170 --> 00:00:57.900
You are so awesome, I love
you, you are so, so funny.

00:00:57.900 --> 00:01:00.355
So we'll put this on our
Meryl Insta page, people.

00:01:00.355 --> 00:01:01.188
You're welcome.

